<title>GERMANY: Merck eyes ongoing strong business in 1997.</title>
<headline>Merck eyes ongoing strong business in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>German pharmaceuticals and drugs group Merck KGaA on Thursday forecast ongoing positive developments after reporting a 13.3 percent rise in turnover during the first five months of 1997.</p>
<p>The group also said it expected the positive business developments to continue throughout the rest of the year.</p>
<p>Part of the reason for the group's strong performance was a 19.2 percent rise turnover in the pharmaceuticals sector.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
